I noticed the cloak you are wearing, <name>. If you'd be willing to sacrifice it, I can renew its magics, and use it to escape. The problem with that, though, is you'll be left here in the cave alone.

Are you able to make it out of here on your own if we choose that course?

I can assure you that Terenthis will reward you for aiding me, if that is your concern.

The choice is yours, but I could really use your help. 
