If we decide to fight our way out, the plan is simple: we'll make our way down to the road and kill any furbolgs that get in our way... or anything else that decides it wants to stop us.

I wish there was another way, but sooner or later the furbolg threat would have to be dealt with. Better it be by our own hands, so we know the job is done.

Take a moment to prepare any magic or weapons you have at your disposal, then speak to me again. 
